{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 140,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Deliver me, O Jehovah, from the evil man;\nPreserve me from the violent man:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who devise mischiefs in their heart;\nContinually do they gather themselves together for war.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have sharpened their tongue like a serpent;\nAdders’ poison is under their lips. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep me, O Jehovah, from the hands of the wicked;\nPreserve me from the violent man:\nWho have purposed to thrust aside my steps.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The proud have hid a snare for me, and cords;\nThey have spread a net by the wayside;\nThey have set gins for me. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I said unto Jehovah, Thou art my God:\nGive ear unto the voice of my supplications, O Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O Jehovah the Lord, the strength of my salvation,\nThou hast covered my head in the day of battle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grant not, O Jehovah, the desires of the wicked;\nFurther not his evil device, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lest",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they exalt themselves. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for the head of those that compass me about,\nLet the mischief of their own lips cover them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let burning coals fall upon them:\nLet them be cast into the fire,\nInto deep pits, whence they shall not rise.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "An evil speaker shall not be established in the earth:\nEvil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I know that Jehovah will maintain the cause of the afflicted,\nAnd justice for the needy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.140.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely the righteous shall give thanks unto thy name:\nThe upright shall dwell in thy presence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ],
  "headings": [
    {
      "style": "s1",
      "text": "Prayer for protection against persecutors.",
      "before_verse": 1
    },
    {
      "style": "d",
      "text": "For the Chief Musician. A Psalm of David.",
      "before_verse": 1
    }
  ]
}
